Marketing Campaign Analytics Dashboard | Excel
Project Overview
Developed an interactive Marketing Campaign Analytics Dashboard in Excel to analyze campaign performance, customer engagement, conversion rates, ROI, customer segments, marketing channels, and geographic performance.
The dashboard transforms campaign data into clear business and marketing insights to support data-driven decision-making and marketing optimization.
Key Features
•	Analyzed overall marketing campaign performance using key KPIs.
•	Evaluated conversion rates and Return on Investment (ROI).
•	Compared campaign performance across different marketing channels.
•	Analyzed customer segments to understand audience behavior.
•	Evaluated geographic performance across different locations.
•	Identified high-performing and low-performing campaigns.
•	Presented campaign results through interactive charts and visual summaries.
Business and Marketing Insights
•	Identified campaigns generating stronger performance and ROI.
•	Compared customer segments to understand differences in engagement and conversion.
•	Evaluated marketing channels to identify stronger-performing channels.
•	Analyzed geographic trends to understand market performance.
•	Identified opportunities to optimize marketing investment.
•	Supported campaign planning through data-driven performance analysis.
